N|          The EARTH recedes below into a ball, RED-HUED' under the
N|          fantastic sun. A fast approaching light FLARES up against
N|          the mirrored surface and is recognised as our MOON. It flashes
N|          past, follows EARTH into e distance. All around, the sky
N|          darkens into the void of space.
