N|          Curving light-rays from another galaxy are drawn fantastically
N|          together and then simply DISAPPEAR as they are pulled in by
N,G|          the unimaginable gravitation force of is THING. we SEE the
N,G|          CAPSULE, tiny, curving, and spinning along amidst the mind-
N|          blowing display of light rays, sucked along with them ····
N|          then simply DISAPPEARING as it too enters the void.
